## Port changes
- view.ts now renders features/system/operator.ts and features/system/extensions.ts instead of the families-view structural placeholders.
- SystemOperator: Operator Controls + capability status grid, Trace lineage table, Replay Jobs table + create form, Evaluation Jobs table, Shadow Learning mode select, learning profile and advisory tables. Real rows only; empty states are explicit.
- SystemExtensions: Readiness counts, contribution posture, recommendation ledger, replay automation, extension inventory with lifecycle/mode/health and Pause per row.
- Readbacks added/wired: learningProfile, learningAdvisory, contribution, recommendations, replayAutomation; SystemOperator init reads status/trace/replay/evaluation/profile/advisory; SystemExtensions init reads extensions/contribution/recommendations/replayAutomation.
- Actions wired to verified host endpoints: recommendation apply/dismiss, replay automation pause/resume, extension pause (existing), download (existing), operator load/create replay (existing), plus replay cancel and evaluation retry/cancel. Recommendation/automation/operator action bodies and encoded job paths are asserted in s637.
- parseLearningFamily now keeps full JSON meta (previously sliced at 600 chars, which made object readbacks unparseable) so capability/contribution/automation objects expand into real rows.

